2914526735568734", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311582_2914526742235400_669716012228252328_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=058tLupPalEQ7kNvwEf6B8z&_nc_oc=AdrJ1GBR1UAVn4ypTN-VbLC_ywQCD-SOUvkKAcrHKTLdYretHOit0YxXe7sQ4J2AItc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQyv-SDcg5jw3WGzN4HW-S3vX2GUN72BnVkSyIxKvpNWA&oe=6AFDCB81"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot.png", "id": "1058264713214991", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310720_1058264716548324_4608452128981644400_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5ko5mHVDS9MQ7kNvwE2rJx5&_nc_oc=AdoeAARxw72ZEjRCAXuIRJy_zYWPNYrWyDFEIM_DoA7cfcCDHoY0DX2Bpx_vh4GgCMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSkEgB8OMnC6NxNGm7mbdwtoxjHt6T5Uf1Msajj5AfU7w&oe=6AFDB8AD"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4.png", "id": "826138013770138", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310734_826138017103471_1122152661442292605_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zg4CUztRKv4Q7kNvwF8B5lS&_nc_oc=AdqHphaTJKXONoI8lwJGBBSAT7HhC0OGg_P0yvr9q7lbRBaoi-rUeOm1Sr5isCA0rLA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ9SipFX4aLlF117AK7cQsiD-b9okmefzSAR7M0XL-JxQ&oe=6AFDB370"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "LOOT", "keywords": ["multiplayer", "mining", "exploration", "survival", "extraction"], "long_description": "**WELCOME TO L.O.O.T** \n\nCongratulations, recruit. You have been selected to join the Logistical Outworld Operational Team, also known as L.O.O.T. \n\n**Your mission is simple:**\n- Explore\n- Find shiny things\n- Bring them home\n- Escape before time is running out\n- Spend your resource to gather more gear and level up\n\n#  Explore the unknown with up to 4 players\n\nExplore faster, carry more resources and help each other survive dangerous situations.\nJust don't be the last Zgoub left trying to find the exit. \nThe timer is always ticking.\n\n#  The more you explore, the greater the rewards.\n\n- Break mineral deposits, collect rare materials and fill your backpack with everything you can carry.\n- Each level contains specific resources that can be used to unlock new equipment, cosmetics and upgrades.\n\n#  Risk everything for more LOOT\ud83d\udc8e\n\nEvery run is a gamble. \n- **Avoid deadly traps**: The caves are full of hazards. Watch your step, stay alert and learn to navigate increasingly dangerous environments.\n- **Find safe zones**: Hidden zones can temporarily protect your team and extend your run. Use them wisely to continue looting and uncover greater rewards.\n\n#  Upgrade your skills\n- Better mining tools \u26cf\ufe0f\n- Larger backpack \ud83d\udcb0\n- Unique cosmetics \u2728\n\n# Want to play the game pre-release, become a playtester and give us feedback ?\n# Join our Discord and play before everyone else!!\nhttps://discord.gg/c9ExCHy43", "short_description": "Mine shiny rocks. Dodge stupid traps. Escape before time runs out. Solo or with up to 4 friends, every run is procedurally generated and every bad decision will have consequences. \nBRING BACK THE LOOT."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.arianestudios.com/loot-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Atlas V", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/ZVEW8Tr88E", "website_url": "https://atlasv.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommende